msgid ""
"I consent to sharing my crop, leaf image, AI prediction, confidence, "
"symptoms, and relevant advisory with an agricultural expert for review. My "
"name, email, and exact location will not be shared."
msgstr ""
"Ninakubali kushiriki zao langu, picha ya jani, utabiri wa AI, ujasiri, "
"dalili, na ushauri unaohusika na mtaalamu wa kilimo kwa ukaguzi. Jina langu,"
" barua pepe, na eneo langu kamili halitashirikiwa."

msgid "Explicit consent is required to request an expert review."
msgstr "Idhini ya wazi inahitajika ili kuomba ukaguzi wa mtaalamu."

msgid ""
"You can share this case with an agricultural expert for a secondary "
"assessment. The expert will see your crop details, image, and the AI's "
"prediction."
msgstr ""
"Unaweza kushiriki kesi hii na mtaalamu wa kilimo kwa tathmini ya pili. "
"Mtaalamu ataona maelezo ya zao lako, picha, na utabiri wa AI."

msgid "Request Expert Review"
msgstr "Omba Ukaguzi wa Mtaalamu"

msgid "Revoke Consent"
msgstr "Batilisha Idhini"

msgid "AI-estimated condition"
msgstr "Hali iliyokadiriwa na AI"

msgid "Possible"
msgstr "Inawezekana"

msgid "This is the model's top visual-pattern match for the uploaded leaf."
msgstr ""
"Huu ndio muundo mkuu wa kuona unaolingana na modeli kwa jani lililopakiwa."

msgid "UNCALIBRATED MODEL CONFIDENCE"
msgstr "UJASIRI WA MODELI USIOPIMWA"

msgid "Model:"
msgstr "Modeli:"

msgid "Estimated result, not a confirmed diagnosis."
msgstr "Matokeo yaliyokadiriwa, si utambuzi uliothibitishwa."

msgid "Confidence is not disease severity or guaranteed accuracy."
msgstr "Ujasiri si ukali wa ugonjwa au usahihi uliohakikishwa."

msgid "Outside disease-specific scope:"
msgstr "Nje ya wigo maalum wa ugonjwa:"

msgid ""
"The model predicted two-spotted spider mites, a pest. The actual model "
"result is preserved, but disease-specific guidance is not provided."
msgstr ""
"Modeli ilitabiri utitiri wa buibui wenye madoa mawili, mdudu mharibifu. "
"Matokeo halisi ya modeli yamehifadhiwa, lakini mwongozo maalum wa ugonjwa "
"hautolewi."

msgid "Uncertain result:"
msgstr "Matokeo yasiyo na uhakika:"

msgid ""
"Confidence is below the provisional 70% threshold. Try another clear leaf "
"photo or seek expert review."
msgstr ""
"Ujasiri uko chini ya kiwango cha mpito cha 70%%. Jaribu picha nyingine wazi "
"ya jani au tafuta ukaguzi wa mtaalamu."

msgid "Analysis could not be completed"
msgstr "Uchambuzi haukuweza kukamilika"

msgid ""
"Your case and image remain saved. You can return later or start another crop"
" check."
msgstr ""
"Kesi yako na picha vinabaki vimehifadhiwa. Unaweza kurudi baadaye au kuanza "
"ukaguzi mwingine wa zao."

msgid "Analysis is not complete"
msgstr "Uchambuzi haujakamilika"

msgid "Continue analysis"
msgstr "Endelea na uchambuzi"

msgid "Agricultural Guidance"
msgstr "Mwongozo wa Kilimo"

